  "description": "Excel file read/write (.xlsx/.xls/.xlsb) for the analyticsLibrary family. Uses NPOI (Apache-2.0) for .xlsx/.xls reading and writing, and ExcelDataReader (MIT) for .xlsb reading. No commercial license required. Writing .xlsb is not supported.",
