  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.1: Pinned patched versions of NPOI transitive dependencies to address security advisories (System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 8.0.3 fixes GHSA-37gx-xxp4-5rgx and GHSA-w3x6-4m5h-cxqf; SixLabors.ImageSharp 2.1.11 fixes GHSA-rxmq-m78w-7wmc). 3.0.0: Removed EPPlus (PolyForm NonCommercial) and System.Data.OleDb. Write APIs ported to NPOI (Apache-2.0). Read APIs use NPOI + ExcelDataReader (MIT). Breaking: removed ExcelWorksheet-based public API surface (getSheet, numberFormatRow/Column, Action<ExcelWorksheet> overloads). See README for migration. 2.0.0: Remodeled from the monolithic analyticsLibrary package. Targets net8.0.",
